{"id":"阿卡","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"阿卡","aliases":["莹","破坏神"],"warnings":["「破坏神」是外界在一日战争后给阿卡安的凶名，帝国篇真相大白后不再使用"],"status":"approved","available_eras":["history","mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"阿卡本名「莹」。","era_states":{"history":"阿卡本名「莹」。12岁时，她介入艾尔伯德遗迹的深层科考，接触「艾拉造物」引发的广域精神污染。她是极少数未受侵蚀的幸存者，在混乱中与其他人一起肃清发生变异的队友，最终仅三人成功突围。\n这次生还引起星神艾拉的注视。她被重构为半神位格，获赐神名「阿卡」，成为艾尔伯德自由都市的三大守护者之一。","mainline":"在后续的战役中，阿卡作为艾拉阵营的技术主脑，确立了自身的战略价值。\n海拉事件结束后，凯瑟琳消失，阿卡向艾拉申请成为人类以便调查，脱离半神之位。\n慵懒；接地气、好说话；俏皮；性格恶劣（雷恩评价）；讨厌自以为是的人；吃布丁；艾尔伯德自由都市至高守护者；被冠'破坏神'畏称；以前也是人类，现为次级神；一日战争降神罚，半座皇城蒸发；被教主用道具强行拉入菲亚身体；委托雷恩调查权杖碎片/立方体；给雷恩'祝福'与诅咒。\n近期降临频繁，状态忧郁哀伤；战斗眼光毒辣，凯瑟琳不在时充当教官；喜欢恶作剧；甩手掌柜，不愿亲自动手；艾尔伯德至高守护者，一日战争时官方记载其发出毁灭光束；赋予菲亚主动召唤自己的权限，全权接管应对海拉。\n平时威严满满或不正经；生气时直呼「你是白痴吗」；点咖啡要超苦、不加糖不加奶、多加浓缩；淡紫色长发、娇小、现代富家大小姐打扮、金瞳；借菲亚身体发声；被抑制器封印在菲亚身体里；把赛琳传送到触手公主空间；用DNA重新捏身体、恢复人类身份；决定前往赫尔帝国调查一日战争真相。\n金眸，能爆发金色气浪，以神力屏蔽掩护同伴；平日里咋咋呼呼，但危急时会主动挡在同伴身前；被教廷骑士团以「艾尔伯德自由都市间谍」之名抓获。\n被囚禁仍冷静隐忍，暗中用神力共振为莉卡定位；在最虚弱最贪婪的时刻出手，隐忍到关键一击；作为「曾经最强的神之容器」；被帝国囚禁、呈大字型献祭抽取神力当「电池」；产能极高，「一个人顶一万人」；在神力回路中掺入干扰，导致辛西娅反噬。\n高傲、嘴硬、不肯服软；前守护者，已被贬为人类，在艾尔伯德指导马克、莉卡研究神力应用；被雷恩戴上抑制器项圈，承诺善待马克莉卡、每天只工作8小时。\n元气满满，会一脚踹开房门；认真谈正事时能迅速正色；科学家型，白大褂、解剖分析；会为信息量过载哀嚎「脑细胞过载」；关键时刻狂热、敢打破约定；与凯瑟琳、阿托兰、林迪雅商议尸鬼异象并委托雷恩调查；解剖尸鬼、向众神报告尸鬼是神力驱动的傀儡、分节点层级；揭示属于「绝对禁忌」的宇宙架构、神力体系与权能知识，特训雷恩；分析星神之塔是覆盖国境线的超巨型复合术式。\n通过通讯提供战场情报；科研组领导。","afterstory":"至今，阿卡仍作为神殿体系的核心技术官，维持整个架构的运转稳定性。\n研究狂人；吐槽、爱凑热闹；怕雷恩；心疼神力配额；看到莉卡金属身体陷入狂热；被雷恩侵犯两小时、留下心理阴影；破译异界通讯、识别星神代码；主持传送门建设。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_00551","statement":"阿卡本名「莹」，12岁时介入艾尔伯德遗迹深层科考，是广域精神污染的幸存者。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「艾拉遗迹事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目73（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00552","statement":"阿卡被星神艾拉重构为半神位格，获赐神名「阿卡」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「艾拉遗迹事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目73（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00553","statement":"阿卡是艾尔伯德自由都市的三大守护者之一。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"自「艾拉遗迹事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目73（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00554","statement":"阿卡在后续战役中作为艾拉阵营的技术主脑。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目73（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00555","statement":"阿卡至今是神殿体系的核心技术官。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目73（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00556","statement":"一日战争中，那道削去赫尔帝国首都一半的光束实际由辛西娅强化、并未杀人，被外界捏造为阿卡所为，使阿卡背上「破坏神」凶名。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「一日战争之后」","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_00557","statement":"海拉事件结束后，凯瑟琳消失，阿卡向艾拉申请成为人类以便调查，就此脱离半神之位。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_00558","statement":"阿卡慵懒","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00559","statement":"阿卡接地气、好说话","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00560","statement":"阿卡俏皮","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00561","statement":"雷恩评价阿卡性格恶劣。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第049"},{"fact_id":"fact_00562","statement":"讨厌自以为是、什么都不知道的人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00563","statement":"阿卡吃布丁","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第048"},{"fact_id":"fact_00564","statement":"是艾尔伯德自由都市传说中的至高守护者","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"第41章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00565","statement":"被外界冠以'破坏神'的畏称","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00566","statement":"阿卡以前也是人类，现为次级神","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00567","statement":"讨厌'破坏神'这个外界乱起的名字","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00568","statement":"被恶魔教主用道具强行拉入菲亚身体","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第46章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00569","statement":"委托雷恩调查权杖碎片/立方体，给雷恩加传感器","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第46章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00570","statement":"立方体失效其实是阿卡所为","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第048"},{"fact_id":"fact_00571","statement":"最近也在调查海拉/上古神之事，但神之间有原则不能多说","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第48章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00572","statement":"给雷恩'祝福'：可自主控制快感积累速度与阈值","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第48章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00573","statement":"诅咒雷恩'阳痿一个月'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第50章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00574","statement":"阿卡与复仇女神神系没有私交；神界各神系分管不同地盘。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位58"},{"fact_id":"fact_00575","statement":"揭示「神之拒绝」——物理规则在绝对位格压制前无效","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第60章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00576","statement":"向「上面」汇报并获准使用部分权限","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第57章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00577","statement":"阿卡平时威严满满或不正经","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位61"},{"fact_id":"fact_00578","statement":"阿卡曾被称作「天才科学少女」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00579","statement":"阿卡用当初的DNA重新捏身体，恢复人类身份，向艾拉申请","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00580","statement":"阿卡点咖啡要超苦、不加糖不加奶、多加浓缩","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00581","statement":"海拉事件中，罗威的复仇线索指向帝国人，这促使阿卡下定决心前往赫尔帝国调查一日战争真相。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"D-4007 + 原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00582","statement":"阿卡把赛琳传送到触手公主的空间","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位65"},{"fact_id":"fact_00583","statement":"阿卡是至高守护者之一","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位66"},{"fact_id":"fact_00584","statement":"一日战争真相：阿卡本意只轰击皇宫做象征性威慑，但辛西娅暗中先将人传送走、再强化阿卡的攻击，制造「毁灭半城」的假象；外界误以为阿卡杀了半城人，阿卡自己亦起疑，这是她后来辞职变人类去帝国调查的原因。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_00585","statement":"阿卡金眸，能爆发金色气浪，以神力屏蔽掩护同伴","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00586","statement":"阿卡平日里咋咋呼呼，但危急时会主动挡在同伴身前","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00587","statement":"阿卡对柯赛特说「菲亚要是少了一根头发，我唯你是问」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位78"},{"fact_id":"fact_00588","statement":"阿卡被教廷骑士团以「艾尔伯德自由都市间谍」之名抓获","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位77"},{"fact_id":"fact_00589","statement":"雷恩称阿卡「那家伙可是神啊」，不担心她被俘","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位80"},{"fact_id":"fact_00590","statement":"阿卡被囚禁在拘束器最前端，呈大字型被献祭，管子比其他人更粗、每次抽取都剧烈痉挛","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"第85章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00591","statement":"阿卡被折磨仍暗中通过神力共振，给莉卡的传送能力提供精确坐标","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位85"},{"fact_id":"fact_00592","statement":"阿卡的产能极高，「一个人能顶一万人」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位85"},{"fact_id":"fact_00593","statement":"阿卡作为曾经最强的神之容器，一直隐忍到辛西娅最虚弱最贪婪的时刻，在神力传输回路里掺入致命干扰","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位86"},{"fact_id":"fact_00594","statement":"阿卡抬起头、眼神燃烧嘲弄的火焰，露出胜利者的笑容","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位86"},{"fact_id":"fact_00595","statement":"高傲嘴硬，「我是高贵的守护者」不肯服软","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00596","statement":"前守护者，已被贬为人类","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「星神之塔事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00597","statement":"制定每天工作18小时的规定，压榨马克、莉卡研究神力产品","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00598","statement":"被雷恩戴上抑制器项圈，收服后承诺「以后每天只工作8小时」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00599","statement":"阿卡是艾尔伯德自由都市三位至高守护者之一，曾被称为守护神。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位58、68"},{"fact_id":"fact_01850","statement":"阿卡后来以身穿白大褂的科学家身份活动。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位105"},{"fact_id":"fact_00600","statement":"阿卡踢开雷恩家门委托任务，被雷恩以「让我爽了」要挟后瘫软在地画圈圈","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位103"},{"fact_id":"fact_00601","statement":"阿卡解剖尸鬼得出结论：尸鬼是神力驱动的傀儡，靠体液交换或神力感染传播，存在节点层级","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位105"},{"fact_id":"fact_00602","statement":"阿卡打破与艾拉的约定，向雷恩等人透露「绝对禁忌」的宇宙架构、星神本质与神力体系知识","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位108"},{"fact_id":"fact_00603","statement":"阿卡用「规则解析技术」的频率共振干扰波在黑色风壁上烧出缺口","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":null,"visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位110"},{"fact_id":"fact_00604","statement":"通过通讯提示战场高能反应与重装单位警报","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainli